#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:324
msgid ""
"Carriers limit how large a multimedia message can be. Images and videos you "
"attach are automatically compressed to fit under this limit before sending.\n"
"\n"
"600 kB is a safe default for most carriers. Pick a smaller value if your "
"messages fail to send, or a larger one if you know your carrier allows it."
msgstr ""
"Makampani a foni amaika malire a kukula kwa uthenga wa multimedia. Zithunzi "
"ndi mavidiyo omwe mumatumiza amachepetsedwa okha kuti akwane malire "
"asanatumizidwe.\n"
"\n"
"600 kB ndi muyeso wokhazikika wotetezeka kwa makampani ambiri. Sankhani "
"muyeso wocheperapo ngati mauthenga anu akulephera kutumizidwa, kapena "
"waukulupo ngati mukudziwa kuti kampani yanu imalola."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:352
msgid ""
"Merging calls into a conference is up to the carrier, and in our testing the "
"results varied from working to dropping the calls. Turn this on to try it on "
"your own subscription. It cannot be officially supported, so leave it off if "
"you would rather your calls behaved predictably."
msgstr "Kuphatikiza mafoni kukhala foni ya gulu zimadalira kampani ya foni, ndipo mu kuyesa kwathu zotsatira zinasiyana kuchokera ku kugwira ntchito bwino mpaka ku kudula mafoni. Yambitsani ichi kuti muyese pa mzere wanu. Sitingathe kuchipereka chithandizo chovomerezeka, chotero chisiyeni chozimitsidwa ngati mukufuna kuti mafoni anu azigwira ntchito monga mukuyembekezera."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:360
msgid ""
"Transferring two calls to each other needs a service the carrier has to "
"provide, and in our testing many carriers either refuse it or end the calls "
"instead. Turn this on to try it on your own subscription. It cannot be "
"officially supported, so leave it off if you would rather your calls behaved "
"predictably."
msgstr "Kulumikiza mafoni awiri kwa wina ndi mnzake kumafuna utumiki womwe kampani ya foni iyenera kupereka, ndipo mu kuyesa kwathu makampani ambiri anakana kapena anadula mafoni m'malo mwake. Yambitsani ichi kuti muyese pa mzere wanu. Sitingathe kuchipereka chithandizo chovomerezeka, chotero chisiyeni chozimitsidwa ngati mukufuna kuti mafoni anu azigwira ntchito monga mukuyembekezera."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:371
msgid ""
"When the modem stops responding, the phone quietly restarts the modem stack "
"by itself and you only hear about it if that fails. The phone is never "
"rebooted automatically. When this is off, the Modem Recovery screen appears "
"instead so you can run the restart yourself."
msgstr "Pamene modemu yasiya kuyankha, foni imayambitsanso pulogalamu ya modemu yokha mwakachetechete, ndipo mumamva za izi pokhapo ngati zimenezo zalephera. Foni sichiyambitsidwanso yokha konse. Pamene ichi chazimitsidwa, chinsalu cha kubwezeretsa modemu chimaonekera m'malo mwake, kuti nokha muyambitsenso."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:386
msgid "The modem is working"
msgstr "Modemu ikugwira ntchito"

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:387
